---
import SecondLayout from "../layouts/SecondLayout.astro";
---

<SecondLayout
  title="Privacy and Cookie Policy | StephBe — Clarity for Leaders & Organisations"
  metaDescription="StephBe helps leaders and organisations gain clarity, build capability and create lasting performance through leadership development, workshops and coaching."
  metaKeywords="leadership development, organisational development, executive coaching, leadership coaching, strategy alignment, performance coaching"
  ogUrl="https://stephbe.ie/"
  classMain=""
>
  <div class="container">
    <div>
      <h1>Privacy and Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p>Last Updated: August 1st, 2026</p>
      <p>
        At Felix Yu LLC ("we," "our," or "us"), we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal
        information you share with us. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and disclose information when
        you visit our website.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect information that identifies, relates to, or could reasonably be linked with you ("Personal
        Information").
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Automatically Collected Information:</strong> When you visit our site, we use Google Analytics to automatically
          collect certain technical data, including your IP address, device type, browser type, operating system, pages viewed,
          referring URLs, and general geographic location.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Information You Provide:</strong> If you submit a contact form, request a quote, or sign up for communications,
          we collect details such as your name, email address, phone number, and message content.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div>
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect for business and operational purposes, including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Operating, maintaining, and improving our website.</li>
          <li>Analyzing website performance and traffic trends via Google Analytics.</li>
          <li>Responding to your inquiries and customer service requests.</li>
          <li>Protecting against fraudulent or illegal activity.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
          We use cookies, web beacons, and similar tracking technologies to analyze trends, administer the website, and
          track user movements.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Managing Cookie Preferences:</li>
          <li>
            You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Please note that disabling cookies may
            affect certain features of the website.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>4. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We share data only with trusted service providers
          who assist us in operating our website and business:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Tracks website traffic and user behavior. For more information on how Google
          processes your data, visit [Google Privacy & Terms](https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites). You
          can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the [Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on](https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>5. State-Specific Privacy Rights (e.g., CCPA / CPRA)</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your state of residence (such as California, Virginia, Colorado, or Connecticut), you may have
          specific rights regarding your Personal Information:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Right to Know / Access: The right to request details about the categories and specific pieces of Personal
            Information we collect.
          </li>
          <li>Right to Delete: The right to request deletion of Personal Information collected from you.</li>
          <li>Right to Correct: The right to request correction of inaccurate Personal Information.</li>
          <li>
            Right to Opt-Out of Sale or Sharing: We do not sell your personal information for monetary compensation.
            If we share data for targeted advertising, you have the right to opt out.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <strong
            ><a href="mailto:felix@felixyullc.com">felix@felixyullc.com</a></strong
          >.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our website is not intended for children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information
          from children under 13.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Business Name:</strong> Felix Yu LLC</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:felix@felixyullc.com">felix@felixyullc.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> [Client Phone Number]</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> Chicago, Illinois</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</SecondLayout>

<style>
  .container {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rich-navy);
    padding-top: 80px;
    div {
      padding: 10px 0px;
      & h1 {
        font: var(--font-h1);
        font-weight: 400;
        color: var(--black);
      }
      & h2 {
        font: var(--font-h3);
        font-weight: 400;
      }
      p,
      li {
        font: var(--font-p1);
      }
    }
  }
</style>
